022: Laundry Room Water Backup. $28,600 incurred.\n- 01/14/2024: Tenant Slip &#x26; Fall. $18,400 incurred.\n- 04/18/2025: Electrical Fire. $71,800 incurred.\n\n# WHY THIS ACCOUNT REMAINS ATTRACTIVE\n\n1. Established ownership and management team\n2. Stable occupancy and diversified tenant base\n3. Ongoing capital improvement investments\n4. Improved water mitigation procedures\n5. No open claims or unresolved litigation\n6. Strong cooperation with carrier recommendations\n\n# COVERAGES REQUESTED\n\n- Commercial Property\n- General Liability\n- Business Income\n- Equipment Breakdown\n- Umbrella — $5M\n\nNathan Brooks\nHeartland Multifamily Insurance Services'} index=2 keys=['company', 'locations', 'coverages', 'prior_insurance', 'loss_history', 'legal', 'broker_notes', 'requested_effective_date', 'summary', '_source_doc', '_doc_type', '_confidence', '_markdown_text'] loss_history_in_ext=3 prior_insurance_in_ext=0 source=realistic_broker_submission_greenfield.pdf
